   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# MODEL FAMILY: MOSS-IMAGE\n\n**Compatible model examples / model location:**\ndiffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors (SFT, general use). The Base checkpoint is for LoRA training.\n\n**Important:** UNETLoader = a MOSS-Image file; CLIPLoader = `qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors` with type **moss_image** (stock Qwen3.5-9B, NOT `qwen3.5_9b_qwen_image_2.1_pe_t2i`); VAELoader = `flux2-vae_small.safetensors`; latent = EmptyFlux2LatentImage. Sizes must be multiples of 16. Official settings: 25 steps, CFG 2.5, er_sde / simple. Prompt with long natural-language English (200+ words); no tag soup or 'masterpiece, 8k'.\n\n**Ollama caption model vs image model:** In `Qwen3VLAbliteratedPromptPair`, `huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct` is an **Ollama image-analysis model**, not your generation checkpoint.\n\n**ComfyUI limitation:** Standard dropdowns still list all matching file types from shared folders; this note and labeled loader indicate what is appropriate, but do not restrict dropdown contents."
   ],
